+# HPA and batching tuning for inference
+
+Guidelines:
+- Start with small BATCH_MAX_SIZE (4–16) and low BATCH_TIMEOUT_SEC (0.01–0.1).
+- Run load tests; monitor latency P50/P95/P99 and GPU utilization.
+- Increase batch size to improve throughput until GPU memory limits or latency targets breached.
+- Use HPA combined with cluster autoscaler for node autoscaling.
+- Capture baseline: p95 at 95th percentile traffic; tune for SLOs.
+
+Tools: ops/ci/load_test_async.py, ops/ci/backpressure_probe.py, nvidia-smi, Prometheus metrics.
+
